<title>GERMANY: TABLE-German June wholesale sales up 5.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-German June wholesale sales up 5.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES     June 97    May 97	 June 96</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (real)	  +5.4     -6.1	     -5.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (nominal)     +7.4     -4.0	     -6.5</p>
<p> Index (real)		     101.1     94.4	     95.9</p>
<p> Index (nominal)		  103.2     96.6	     96.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The office also said that during the first six months of this  year, wholesale sales climbed a real one percent from the same period  a year ago and were up a nominal two percent.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
